{"id": 10392, "slug": "metamorph", "name": "MetaMorph", "name_original": "MetaMorph", "description": "<h3>KAFKA-ESQUE GIRLHOOD</h3><p><strong>Metamorph </strong>is a 3D story-driven dating sim with a horror theme, about growing up in a body that quickly becomes foreign to you. You play as a high-school girl who has begun to slowly, but steadily, turn into a <strong>twisted cockroach monster</strong>. With no signs of being able to reverse it, she sets out to score a date with her crush, all before her <strong>grotesque transformation</strong> is fully complete.</p><h3>HELL IS A TEENAGE GIRL</h3><p>Navigate through social situations, interact with an unique cast of characters, and try your best to deal with your <strong>morphing body.</strong> As each day passes and your relationship with your crush unravels, <strong>your transformation spreads </strong>- The tendrils of your mind will begin playing tricks on you, making it harder and harder to conceal your condition.</p><h3>A VERMINOUS WORLD</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Partial Voice Acting </strong></p></li><li><p><strong>17k+ Words of Dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>5 Interactable NPC's</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Secret Side Quests</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>3 Different Endings</strong></p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-03-04", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-03-07T12:12:49", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/28e/28e276ef4fb15d20e8421099b42ec7ac.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/421/4212e6b82d56aab9fef451f12dc0a04f.jpg", "website": "http://www.fireflyworlds.com/metamorph/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 2, "percent": 50.0}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 25.0}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 1, "percent": 25.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 249, "added_by_status": {"yet": 5, "owned": 240, "beaten": 1, "topl