rush, all before her grotesque transformation is fully complete.HELL IS A TEENAGE GIRLNavigate through social situations, interact with an unique cast of characters, and try your best to deal with your morphing body. As each day passes and your relationship with your crush unravels, your transformation spreads - The tendrils of your mind will begin playing tricks on you, making it harder and harder to conceal your condition.A VERMINOUS WORLDPartial Voice Acting 17k+ Words of Dialogue5 Interactable NPC'sSecret Side Quests3 Different Endings"}